From 8042704d2a049b815e830156062a935af2d50a8f Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Brendan Lynskey <brendanlynskey@googlemail.com>
Date: Tue, 3 Nov 2026 01:17:59 +0000
Subject: [PATCH 4/6] hw/timer: add the BRV32P timer

A model of the timer of the BRV32P SoC: a prescaler, a compare register and
an auto-reload counter, with a sticky match flag that is the timer
interrupt. The counters are brought up to date from virtual time on each
access, and a QEMU timer is set for the match.

Signed-off-by: Brendan Lynskey <brendanlynskey@googlemail.com>

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
---
 hw/timer/Kconfig                |   3 +
 hw/timer/brv32p_timer.c         | 339 ++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++++
 hw/timer/meson.build            |   1 +
 include/hw/timer/brv32p_timer.h |  58 ++++++
 4 files changed, 401 insertions(+)
 create mode 100644 hw/timer/brv32p_timer.c
 create mode 100644 include/hw/timer/brv32p_timer.h

